# AGENTS.md

Subagent definitions for the agentic-workflow plugin. Invoke these from the harness
(subagent picker or Task tool) to keep the main thread focused.

Definitions are symlinked into `.cursor/agents/` by `bootstrap/install.sh` (source:
`~/.cursor/plugins/local/agentic-workflow/agents/`, or the clone's `cursor/agents/`
when the local plugin is not installed yet).

| Agent | Use when |
|---|---|
| **planner** | A risk-first implementation roadmap is needed in isolation (e.g. during `/plan-feature`) |
| **researcher** | Library or API research would bloat the main thread |
| **reviewer** | A findings-only code review is needed before fixing (e.g. during `/review-loop`) |
| **pr-reviewer** | A scored PR review (0–5, eight dimensions) before posting a PR comment |

